msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"(...Rest in peace, Nishiki. You were a great friend right\r\n"
"until the very end.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "(Nishiki. As long as I can remember, you were my friend... and my brother.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"(We were both taken in by Kazama-san at Sunflower Orphanage,\r\n"
"then joined a yakuza organization called the Dojima Family,\r\n"
"led by Patriarch Sohei Dojima.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"(But when Yumi got kidnapped, you murdered Dojima...\r\n"
"and threw all our lives into turmoil.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"(I decided to leave Yumi with you and spent ten years in\r\n"
"jail after taking the fall for the murder you committed.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"(I sacrificed the world for you, yet Yumi's disappearance\r\n"
"and your sister's illness led you down a path of despair.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"(When I saw you again ten years later... you were a changed\r\n"
"man. All you cared about was becoming chairman of the\r\n"
"Tojo Clan.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"(In the end, you and I fought over the 10 billion yen that\r\n"
"had been stolen from the Tojo.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "(Even still, you... you sacrificed yourself to save me.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "(I wouldn't be standing here now if it wasn't for you.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"(...Rest in peace, Nishiki. You were a great friend right\r\n"
"until the very end.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1912"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""